": "BookmanPlain", "color": 2301728, "alpha": 255, "ascender": 0.8859999775886536, "descender": -0.25099998712539673, "text": "accomplished what had hitherto seemed possible for", "origin": [74.60800170898438, 344.3799133300781], "bbox": [74.60800170898438, 332.8619079589844, 407.3080139160156, 347.6429138183594]}], "wmode": 0, "dir": [1.0, 0.0], "bbox": [74.60800170898438, 332.8619079589844, 407.3080139160156, 347.6429138183594]}, {"spans": [{"size": 13.0, "flags": 4, "bidi": 0, "char_flags": 16, "font": "BookmanPlain", "color": 2301728, "alpha": 255, "ascender": 0.8859999775886536, "descender": -0.25099998712539673, "text": "only short periods of time. From the latter half of the", "origin": [74.60800170898438, 359.97991943359375], "bbox": [74.60800170898438, 348.4619140625, 407.3951416015625, 363.242919921875]}], "wmode": 0, "dir": [1.0, 0.0], "bbox": [74.60800170898438, 348.4619140625, 407.3951416015625, 363.242919921875]}, {"spans": [{"size": 13.0, "flags": 4, "bidi": 0, "char_flags": 16, "font": "BookmanPlain", "color": 2301728, "alpha": 255, "ascender": 0.8859999775886536, "descender": -0.25099998712539673, "text": "sixteenth century they expanded their kingdom from", "origin": [74.60800170898438, 375.5799255371094], "bbox": [74.60800170898438, 364.0619201660156, 407.28717041015625, 378.8429260253906]}], "wmode": 0, "dir": [1.0, 0.0], "bbox": [74.60800170898438, 364.0619201660156, 407.28717041015625, 378.8429260253906]}, {"spans": [{"size": 13.0, "flags": 4, "bidi": 0, "char_flags": 16, "font": "BookmanPlain", "color": 2301728, "alpha": 255, "ascender": 0.8859999775886536, "descender": -0.25099998712539673, "text": "Agra and Delhi until in the seventeenth century they", "origin": [74.60800170898438, 391.179931640625], "bbox": [74.60800170898438, 379.66192626953125, 407.3091125488281, 394.44293212890625]}], "wmode": 0, "dir": [1.0, 0.0], "bbox": [74.60800170898438, 379.66192626953125, 407.3091125488281, 394.44293212890625]}, {"spans": [{"size": 13.0, "flags": 